            "sid": "GAL 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngisho lokhu ukuthi isivumelwano esaqiniswa ngaphambili nguNkulunkulu kuKristu, umthetho owaba khona emva kweminyaka engamakhulu amane namashumi amathathu, awunakuchithwa, ukuze usenze ize isithembiso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
